###############################################################################
# EXPECTED UI MODEL
#
# CENTAIVA PLATFORM
#   Platform Control Login (tenantless)
#     -> Bootstrap
#     -> Admin scope
#
#   Product Tenant Login
#     -> Select tenant
#     -> Final tenant-bound token
#     -> Session policy
#
#   Platform Owner navigation
#     -> Overview
#     -> Organizations
#     -> Tenants
#     -> Users
#     -> Products
#     -> Applications
#     -> Modules / Features
#     -> Roles / Permissions
#     -> Integrations
#     -> Onboarding
#     -> Feature Flags
#     -> Service Accounts
#     -> Audit
#
#   Product launch
#     WorkWell Finance
#       -> product login
#       -> eligible tenant picker
#       -> select/switch tenant
#       -> exchange selectionCode
#       -> navigate to WorkWell with final tenant-bound token
#
#     MedPure
#       -> same WORKWELL_FINANCE application/client
#       -> MedPure tenant selection
#       -> final MedPure tenant-bound WorkWell Finance token
#
# Platform hierarchy inside WORKWELL_FINANCE:
#   WorkWell parent organization
#     -> Eutopia Search tenant/company
#     -> Patrick Morgan tenant/company
#   MedPure tenant/company
#
# NEVER
#   - use a Control token as a WorkWell Finance data token
#   - change local CompId to switch Central tenants
#   - allow one tenant-bound token to read another WorkWell company
###############################################################################
